OL,3,GNEWSATown bedecked with bra bunting for
OL,4,Acancer campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost a mile (1.6km) of donated
OL,7,Fundergarments and pink bunting are
OL,8,Fdecorating shop fronts, railings and
OL,9,Fstreets in a Lincolnshire town.
OL,11,FVolunteers took eight weeks to create
OL,12,Fthe display from 300 donated bras to
OL,13,Ffundraise for a breast cancer charity.
OL,15,FKim Penfold, from All In Pink Epworth,
OL,16,Fsaid most people had been affected by
OL,17,Fbreast cancer in some way.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
