OL,3,GNEWSATown bedecked with bra bunting for
OL,4,Acancer campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The project is to raise awareness to
OL,7,Fthe young, and also, to men. Spread the
OL,8,Fword that breast cancer doesn't care
OL,9,Fhow you identify, or what your age is,
OL,10,Fyou unfortunately have the potential of
OL,11,Fgetting breast cancer."
